    "name": "The Blue Cut Hook",
    "steam_appid": 3360770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/06bb15b629b11cebf3719b87c5209bae.avif?t=1755098659\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the warm glow of your very own tavern, where good food, great company, and grand adventures await! In <strong>The Blue Cut Hook</strong>, you're not just a business owner\u2014you\u2019re a friend, a mentor, and a cornerstone of the community. Build lasting relationships, craft mouthwatering meals, forge mighty weapons, and embark on thrilling quests to create the ultimate haven for adventurers and townsfolk alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7b <strong>From Stranger to Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tavern is more than just a place to eat\u2014it\u2019s a home. Lend a listening ear, solve problems, and earn the trust of your patrons. With each bond you forge, your reputation grows, and soon enough, you\u2019ll find yourself at the heart of a thriving community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf72 <strong>Cook Up Something Legendary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great tavern needs great food! Scour the world for exotic ingredients, unlock secret recipes, and craft a menu that keeps adventurers coming back for more. Will you serve hearty comfort food or daring new flavors from distant lands? The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Forge, Craft, and Equip</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers need the right gear to survive their quests, and that\u2019s where you come in! Hire a blacksmith, gather rare materials, and create powerful weapons and armor to aid your patrons. A well-equipped adventurer is a happy (and generous!) customer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Build a Thriving Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tavern, cultivate fresh ingredients, brew magical potions, and discover new ways to increase your profits. The path to success is filled with choices\u2014will you run a cozy family inn, a bustling adventurer\u2019s hub, or something truly unique?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Quests Await!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all challenges happen within your walls. Accept requests from villagers, nobles, and even the royal court! Hunt down elusive creatures, gather rare materials, and solve mysteries that could change the fate of your town. Adventure is never far away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tavern is waiting. Are you ready to create a place where stories unfold, friendships blossom, and legends are made?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nostalgic 90\u2019s anime visual</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A D&amp;D-like world with character designs inspired by the classic anime art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/95eb64eacb72efc2ea441304e8cd5d22.avif?t=1755098659\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/06bb15b629b11cebf3719b87c5209bae.avif?t=1755098659\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the warm glow of your very own tavern, where good food, great company, and grand adventures await! In <strong>The Blue Cut Hook</strong>, you're not just a business owner\u2014you\u2019re a friend, a mentor, and a cornerstone of the community. Build lasting relationships, craft mouthwatering meals, forge mighty weapons, and embark on thrilling quests to create the ultimate haven for adventurers and townsfolk alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7b <strong>From Stranger to Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tavern is more than just a place to eat\u2014it\u2019s a home. Lend a listening ear, solve problems, and earn the trust of your patrons. With each bond you forge, your reputation grows, and soon enough, you\u2019ll find yourself at the heart of a thriving community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf72 <strong>Cook Up Something Legendary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great tavern needs great food! Scour the world for exotic ingredients, unlock secret recipes, and craft a menu that keeps adventurers coming back for more. Will you serve hearty comfort food or daring new flavors from distant lands? The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Forge, Craft, and Equip</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers need the right gear to survive their quests, and that\u2019s where you come in! Hire a blacksmith, gather rare materials, and create powerful weapons and armor to aid your patrons. A well-equipped adventurer is a happy (and generous!) customer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Build a Thriving Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tavern, cultivate fresh ingredients, brew magical potions, and discover new ways to increase your profits. The path to success is filled with choices\u2014will you run a cozy family inn, a bustling adventurer\u2019s hub, or something truly unique?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Quests Await!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all challenges happen within your walls. Accept requests from villagers, nobles, and even the royal court! Hunt down elusive creatures, gather rare materials, and solve mysteries that could change the fate of your town. Adventure is never far away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tavern is waiting. Are you ready to create a place where stories unfold, friendships blossom, and legends are made?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nostalgic 90\u2019s anime visual</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A D&amp;D-like world with character designs inspired by the classic anime art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360770/extras/95eb64eacb72efc2ea441304e8cd5d22.avif?t=1755098659\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Blue Cut Hook blends cozy tavern management with subtle adventure. You're no hero, just a humble tavern keeper, but your food, gear, and advice quietly shape the adventurers who pass through. They make the choices, take the glory, and face the danger, but your influence might keeps them alive.",
